PathIQ

About the Project:
PathIQ is an AI-powered Android application designed to help students improve their
employability and career readiness. The application focuses on providing students
with personalized guidance and resources to prepare for their future careers.

Features:
Personalized career guidance
Career recommendations
Resume-building support
Coding practice
Mock interview preparation
Career-related resources
Employability improvement guidance

Technologies Used:
Python
AI / Machine Learning concepts
Android Development

What I Learned:
Working on PathIQ helped me explore the use of AI in solving practical problems faced
by students. I gained experience in thinking about user needs, career-oriented application
design, and applying technology to create a useful solution.
